OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,4,F
OL,5, Police in Londonderry have made a
OL,6, number of arrests in the city and those
OL,7, held are being questioned about last
OL,8, night's murder of two soldiers.
OL,9,                          F
OL,10,FThe IRA has said it planted a bomb
OL,11,Fwhich was detonated by remote control
OL,12,Fas two army vehicles passed by.
OL,14,FThe dead men were in the Royal
OL,15,FArtillery and were travelling in a Land
OL,16,FRover heading towards the border.
OL,18,FThey have been named as Gunner Daniel
OL,19,FAmos, 18, from Bristol in Avon, and
OL,20,FLance Bombardier Stephen Cummings, 24,
OL,21,Ffrom Portsmouth in Hampshire.
OL,23,T]CFrom 09-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,1fc,190,120,250,0,100
PN,18103
SC,0003
CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1773098339
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G3/8
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The Prime Minister has told the Commons
OL,6, that the Government will not pay for
OL,7, environmental safeguards for the high-
OL,8, speed Channel Tunnel rail link.
OL,9,F
OL,10,F"It is Government policy that the users
OL,11,Fof the new line should pay for the full
OL,12,Fcosts," she said.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FKent MP Mr Edward Heath appealed to Mrs
OL,15,FThatcher to allow #500 million from
OL,16,Fpublic funds for the measures.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FBut she said other forms of travel to
OL,19,Fthe Continent were not subsidised;
OL,20,FBritish Rail was consulting the private
OL,21,Fsector about the money needed.
OL,23,T]CFrom 09-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,1fc,190,120,250,0,100
PN,18104
SC,0004
CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1773098339
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G4/8
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Twelve people have been arrested in
OL,6, London and the south east after customs
OL,7, officers seized drugs worth #40 million
OL,8, which arrived on a ferry at Portsmouth.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FEleven of the arrested are Britons and
OL,11,Fone is a Colombian; some are said to be
OL,12,Fbaggage handlers at Gatwick airport.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FThe haul, discovered in a shipping
OL,15,Fcontainer, was made up of two tons of
OL,16,Fcannabis and 300lbs of cocaine - the
OL,17,Fmost cocaine ever seized in the UK.
OL,19,FThe container arrived aboard a
OL,20,Ffreighter on Tuesday night from Ecuador
OL,21,Fhaving stopped at Le Havre en route.
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 09-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,1fc,190,120,250,0,100
PN,18105
SC,0005
CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1773098339
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G5/8
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The Metropolitan Police say they seized
OL,6, 62 kilos of very high quality cocaine
OL,7, worth between #25 million and #30
OL,8, million in north London today.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FFollowing a covert operation, three
OL,11,Fpeople were arrested in Swiss Cottage
OL,12,Ftoday; cocaine was found in their care.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FAddresses in north London were then
OL,15,Fsearched, and 60 kilos of the drug were
OL,16,Ffound at an address in Finchley.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FThe three who were arrested are
OL,19,Fbelieved to be a Dutch woman and two
OL,20,Fmen, one British and one from Peru.
OL,21,FThey are being questioned.
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 09-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,1fc,190,120,250,0,100
