PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1773098339
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G7/8
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Nine members of staff at the Iranian
OL,6, embassy are to be deported from Britain
OL,7, if they do not leave voluntarily,
OL,8, Whitehall sources have said.
OL,10,FThe Iranians do not hold diplomatic
OL,11,Fstatus and were thus not forced to
OL,12,Fleave after tie2 were severed with Iran
OL,13,Fbecause of the Salman Rushdie affair.
OL,15,FIf the nine refuse to return to Iran,
OL,16,Fdeportation orders will be signed by
OL,17,Fthe Home Secretary within 10 days.
OL,19,FOther expulsions are expected to
OL,20,Ffollow. Britain has alrjady moved to
OL,21,Fexpel up to 30 Iranians.
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 09-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
